# cabin_embers: the fire bowl glowing at the evening's blue hour and at
# night (lead call 55): a ring of embers in its mouth (the fire cycle, 20:
# rust, pink, cream, never gold), warm spill on its rim, and a faint ring
# of it on the grass around. The anchor, 0,0, is at_bowl, the mouth's
# middle.
C 20  L -6,0 L -4,-1 L -2,0 L 0,-1 L 2,0 L 4,-1 L 6,0 L -5,1 L -1,1 L 3,1 L 5,1 L -3,2 L 1,2
C 28  L -10,-2 L -7,-3 L 7,-3 L 10,-2 L -11,0 L 11,0 L 16,9 L 14,11 L 10,12 L -11,12 L -14,10 L -16,9 L -16,7 L -14,5 L 11,4 L 14,6 L 16,7
